---@field desired_cost_per_result? number Cost per result to aim for (`average_target`) or never exceed (`maximum_target`).
---@field detailed_targeting? whop.ad_groups.AdGroupDetailedTargetingBody Interest, behavior, and demographic targeting, using categories from the ad platform's targeting taxonomy. Entries across interests, behaviors, and demographics are OR'd together (anyone matching any entry is reached), matching Ads Manager's detailed-targeting box. At most 100 entries per section. Can't be combined with demographics.automatic, and unavailable to campaigns with special_ad_categories. Send the complete intended state — a section you omit is cleared.
